                "img": "https://arxiv.org/html/2610.03664/2610.03664v1/ProAR-Model_cropped.png",
                "caption": "Figure 2:Overview of ProAR. (a) Input: For a given video, the model processes the history, current, and goal streams within a forward pass. (b) Outcome: The causal DiT jointly denoises the current chunk and goal frame, where an attention mask enables the clean history and evolving goal belief to guide current generation. (c) Transition: A training-only projector aligns the middle-layer hidden states of the noisy current chunk (student) with the clean next chunk (teacher).",
